# Build artifacts. `target/` is regenerated by `fitz build --target
# wasm-client`; `pkg/` is the local mirror `build.sh` makes next to
# index.html for serving. Neither is committed — a fresh clone rebuilds
# with `./build.sh` (needs the `fitz` CLI + rust wasm target + wasm-pack).
/target/
/pkg/
/fitz.lock
